WEBVTT

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:24.250
Shinku, it's morning.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.240
Good morning!

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:39.940
And thus starts another tedious day
with the puny human.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.560
Shinku still hasn't said good morning?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.490
No.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.170
Shinku, it's morning!

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:51.010
You'll get scolded if you 
don't open your eyes.

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.870
She just won't wake up.

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:59.800
Maybe she was damaged in her fight
with that Suigintou doll.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.350
Hina doesn't know.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.240
Since it's come to this, I've no choice.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.960
I'll take her place and 
make you my servants.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.490
Come along.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:16.030
Like hell I'll become your servant,
you rotten doll.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.480
Why so worked up?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.080
Do you prefer Shinku after all?

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.230
D-Don't be stupid.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.460
That's not what I meant.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.620
Dreams

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.460
U-Um, here.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.830
I'm sorry.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.870
We don't accept solicitors.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:57.340
Door-to-door sales pitches
are getting more elaborate lately.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:03.910
Jun-kun, is there a fire?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.200
Oh, it was alarm clocks.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.830
I thought it was a fire alarm.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.300
Do we have a fire alarm?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.850
Shinku-chan isn't up yet?

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:25.280
No. Nori, what'll we do?

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:30.460
Well, I don't know much about
magical dolls either, so...

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.080
Really, you're all such softies.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.980
Come back to the day before yesterday.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:38.580
What? Then you know how to wake her up?

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.740
Of course.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.130
What is this?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:00.010
When the medium that provides
their power is in danger...

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.300
...dolls tend to respond.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.310
Hey, wait! Hey!

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:05.310
Here goes.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.440
Stop!

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.710
No sign of waking.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.600
That's strange.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.250
Then an even greater danger...

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.090
I'll die! 
That'll kill me!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:24.590
Oh? What's this hole?

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:26.490
Oh, that's...

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.000
Damn, don't say unnecessary things.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.930
You rotten doll. 
You knew?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.670
Thank goodness!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.430
She should wake up now!

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:46.780
Thank goodness my ass!

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:50.280
This should...

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.180
Hey, wake up.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.950
Come on, wake up.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:01.070
Shinku's not waking up.

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:02.250
That can't be.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.490
Shinku? Shinku.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.210
This is so impossible.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:14.220
Watch our serious 
marionette drama mystery!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.470
Oh, it's Kun-kun!

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:18.810
Shinku, it's Detective Kun-kun.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.060
What are you doing?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:37.370
She'll wake up if Kun-kun does it.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.200
Me?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.600
You're the only one who can do Kun-kun!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.140
Hi, Shinku, thanks for 
always supporting me.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:51.400
Actually, I want you to 
help with an investigation.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.790
Won't you open your eyes?

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.540
What's wrong?

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.970
Could it be someone's threatening you
so you can't talk?

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:04.770
Or are you too embarrassed 
to say anything?

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:07.880
Shinku...

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:13.820
Jun-kun...

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.170
We won't know if you don't talk to us.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.720
What's wrong?

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:22.460
Shinku...

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:28.410
Jun-kun, I'll try to think of some ideas
while I'm at school too.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.410
So don't give up. 
Let's keep at it.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.340
Keep out of it.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.150
We finally got rid of 
one, and it's quieter.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.960
You puny human.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.020
Don't worry.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.130
Jun-kun will do something.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.690
I'm sure of it.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:49.340
How long has it been since
I've seen him look like that?

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.800
<i>"Rozen Maiden.</i>

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.670
<i>Dolls allegedly created by
legendary doll maker Rozen.</i>

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.890
<i>They are masterpieces
referred to as 'living dolls.'</i>

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.670
<i>But no one's ever seen them...</i>

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.890
<i>...and there are doubts 
whether they even exist."</i>

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.770
No matter where I look,
it's always the same information.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:23.400
I know.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.400
I think I saw a site once...

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.400
-Doll Lovers' Society-

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:32.040
Does anyone know anything
about Rozen Maidens?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.110
JUN> Does anyone know anything 
about Rozen Maidens?

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.110
Yoshimoto> By Rozen Maidens, you mean that Rozen?

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.200
Mitsue> But I heard it was a made-up story*

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.050
akane> I heard it wasn't true too.

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:44.050
MATSUO> You believe that stuff? 
No way it exists.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.740
They do exist.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.560
Right here.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.610
Sheesh...

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.820
Jun, are you napping?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.190
You really are good for nothing.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.110
And at a time like this.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:19.120
What'll happen to Shinku at this rate?

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.860
She'll continue to dream.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:25.190
Dream?

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:29.400
Dolls dream when they 
enter a deep sleep.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:34.350
Born as dolls, the meetings
we experience over and over...

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:37.420
Our feelings for Father 
in distant memory...

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.410
And the sudden darkness...

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.260
An eternal sleep,
 denied even death.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.950
Encased in blackness, 
unable to even move...

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.840
Despair and anticipation.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.580
Joy and pain.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.740
Her feelings since being born a doll...

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:57.940
She'll just relive all those memories
over and over.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.440
Damn it...

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.310
"They aren't fictional.
 I believe the title is..."

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:09.100
What is it, Jun?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.880
You stay with Shinku.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.710
Don't answer the door for anyone.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.610
Got it?

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.640
I swear.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.680
That runt really pisses me off.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:25.620
Library

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.950
Doll lore,
Rozen's dolls,
doll creation list,
Dolls Rosa,
Doll Maker's World

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.830
There it is.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:40.330
B-6... B-7...

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.000
Those books aren't here.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:53.570
The library's being renovated,
so they're at another location.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.100
Where is that?

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.450
That middle school.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:57.880
You know it, don't you?

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.770
<i>That Sakurada...</i>

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.160
W-Who said that?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.450
<i>Hey, did you hear?</i>

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.040
<i>That Sakurada-kun...</i>

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.420
Who's there? Stop it.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.430
S-Stop it!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:11:59.850
Stop it!

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.080
Please stop!

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:42.950
Um...

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.380
What?

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:52.110
Hina-Ichigo gets her share
of power from Shinku.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.910
Without Shinku, her power is gone.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.560
No way...

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:03.440
If you're Shinku's 
servant, do something!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:08.050
Use that mini-mini-brain and think,
you good-for-nothing!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.370
Shut up!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:13.930
So I'm a good-for-nothing.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.740
Hina-chan's asleep too?

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.580
Yes.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.680
Where's Jun-kun?

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.890
He really is a good-for-nothing.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.500
He's been in his room awhile.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.920
I see.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.720
Jun-kun, what about dinner?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:39.500
Don't want any.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.060
Could we talk a bit?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.270
No way.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.090
Then I'll just talk.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.520
When I saw your
serious face this morning...

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.280
I was reminded of our youth.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.280
Remember?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.790
When I lost my stuffed animal.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:14:00.290
You worked so hard to make one for me.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.840
I was so surprised.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:07.410
I never dreamed you were able to
make one all by yourself.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.770
I thought you could do anything then...

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:13.620
Shut up!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.470
I keep saying I don't want comfort!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:17.700
Don't give me hollow words!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.250
I'm a good-for-nothing anyway.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.460
I can't even get into school!

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:23.950
Jun-kun...

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.100
I'm finished already!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:28.360
I can only stay cooped up in the house!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.950
I can't do anything!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.570
If you get that, hurry up and leave!

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.340
Leave!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:39.090
You know, Jun-kun...

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.760
Shinku-chan loves you, Jun-kun.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.550
Shinku thinks of me that way?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.760
There's no way...

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.470
<i>You're wonderful, Jun.</i>

00:14:55.680 --> 00:15:01.260
<i>It's as if your fingers 
produce a beautiful melody.</i>

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.750
Sakurada-kun...

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.090
Morning.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.130
Oh, good morning.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.760
Were you looking at something?

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.730
Oh, no. Nothing.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.670
Well, I'll see you later.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:41.210
Library

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.080
Huh?

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.220
It's locked in the mornings.

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:52.720
Why not wear your uniform 
if you were coming?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.940
N-None of your business.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:56.000
Did you want to get in?

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:00.130
I happen
to be researching for a teacher.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.640
Then Hina-Ichigo's asleep too?

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:10.610
Japanese
Literature
Collection

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.440
Pretty much.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.610
So you came all this way?

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.850
I-It's not really like that.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.130
This is it.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.290
Rozen...

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.390
...Maiden.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:28.620
It's German.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:32.630
"What I'm about to write is word
about the dollmaker Rozen...

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.720
...and this is advance warning
that its veracity is not certain."

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:41.220
When Hina-Ichigo showed 
up, I researched.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.990
Then what about repairs?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.480
I didn't get that far.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:46.910
But it's probably here.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.380
This book can't be checked out.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.660
We'll have to start reading now.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.150
Different method.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:58.550
Fix.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.640
Try to entrust.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.830
What's this "naturgeist"?

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:05.630
It's a spirit.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:08.120
Spirit?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:10.760
We're supposed to entrust
the matter to something like that?

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:16.540
Do you know how to summon
that artificial spirit?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.670
I can probably find out 
from that rotten doll.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.940
Kashiwaba, you in there?

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:25.450
Come this way.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:32.100
No one's here now.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:33.350
You know the back gate, right?

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.020
Y-Yeah.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.460
Hurry.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:44.360
Um, s-sorry for dragging you into this.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.840
Here goes.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.700
The back?

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:53.630
Shinku...

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:15.890
Shinku...

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.520
Shinku!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.220
Shinku!

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:27.960
Ow...

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.580
Honestly.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.240
You took too long to wake me.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:36.040
Such a useless servant.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.540
A little thought 
should have solved this.

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.480
W-Why you...

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.040
I was worried...

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.050
Were you?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.550
N-No...

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:51.290
Your eyes seem too red 
for that, Jun-kun.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.360
Well, I will at least 
voice my appreciation.

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:01.130
Thank you, Jun.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.190
How long do you plan to sleep?

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.620
Wake up.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.180
Shinku...

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.310
Jun, hurry up and bring me tea.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.280
W-Why me?

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:20.780
What a vexing servant.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.170
I told you that it was your duty.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.050
I don't recall that!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.490
Your heart's as mini as ever.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.510
What's that?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.130
Come now. Wake up.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.040
Shut up...

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:35.240
He's suddenly energetic
now that Shinku's awake.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.400
Don't be stupid!

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:01.820
That's right, Shinku.

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:03.770
You can't break down yet.

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:08.300
I'll be the one to turn you into junk.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.040
What is it, Suiseiseki?

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:45.810
N-Nothing.

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:48.930
I'm just a little worried about
how that branch is growing.

00:23:49.290 --> 00:23:53.060
If she were here, she could
trim everything neatly.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:55.960
We may never reach an understanding.

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:58.500
Don't say such sorrowful things.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:02.200
She is your beloved younger twin sister.

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:04.290
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:07.470
Swear upon this rose ring.

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 8
Souseiseki
